{"id":"npc:%E7%9D%9A","profile":[{"title":"人物简介","text":"巨兽“睚”的代理人，裁错春秋，剪宇怀腹。过去被逐出炎国。联合山海众来到玉门，带着愤怒欲找岁的踪迹并进行质问。其中在玉门多次出手，包括在会议上刺杀魏彦吾，袭击太和，在铸剑坊混战，截击杜遥夜运送天灾数据。最终以玉门的目的地知道了岁的位置。通过莫佚知晓“不反”所在，但来迟一步，只见到被望取代的岁，怒火无从发泄。最后将原初源石用权能塞入岁体内作为报复。","spoiler":true,"source":"活动剧情WB-ST-1_忽梦少年事、WB-1_塞上春来等。"}],"artCandidates":[{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_786_1-1$2.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_786_1-1$2.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_786_1-1$2.png"}],"appearances":[{"story":"activities/act23side/level_act23side_09_beg","lineCount":1,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":567,"line":568,"speaker":"睚","text":"你要留我？"}]},{"story":"activities/act23side/level_act23side_09_end","lineCount":39,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":13,"line":14,"speaker":"睚","text":"……"},{"commandIndex":55,"line":56,"speaker":"睚","text":"你可还记得，那破开云霭的眼睛？我们在苍穹间对视，碰撞，川江淤赤，群山夷为平地，伏尸耸入云霄，溃脓腐烂后化作新的峰岭……"},{"commandIndex":455,"line":456,"speaker":"睚","text":"……"}]},{"story":"activities/act40side/level_act40side_st03","lineCount":9,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":189,"line":190,"speaker":"睚","text":"什么人？"},{"commandIndex":243,"line":244,"speaker":"睚","text":"我要找的，是那个被囚禁在陵墓里的，可耻的叛徒。"},{"commandIndex":257,"line":258,"speaker":"睚","text":"……"}]},{"story":"activities/act49side/level_act49side_03_beg","lineCount":20,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":86,"line":87,"speaker":"睚","text":"你在这里，做什么？"},{"commandIndex":214,"line":215,"speaker":"睚","text":"至于你们……我见过祂的许多化身，却没有一个能堂堂正正地回答我的问题，再留又有何益？"},{"commandIndex":216,"line":217,"speaker":"睚","text":"……可笑。"}]},{"story":"activities/act49side/level_act49side_08_end","lineCount":2,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":659,"line":660,"speaker":"睚","text":"你答应要给我的东西。"},{"commandIndex":661,"line":662,"speaker":"睚","text":"交出来。"}]},{"story":"activities/act49side/level_act49side_09_end","lineCount":48,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":340,"line":341,"speaker":"睚","text":"答应我的东西，在何处？"},{"commandIndex":756,"line":757,"speaker":"睚","text":"那你们便用箭、用杖，用你们那模仿蝼蚁的身姿，一个一个地破去你们眼中这些棺椁好了！"},{"commandIndex":760,"line":761,"speaker":"睚","text":"看这桩纠缠千年的公案，究竟如何了结。"}]},{"story":"activities/act49side/level_act49side_11_end","lineCount":26,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":270,"line":271,"speaker":"睚","text":"我们终于见面了。"},{"commandIndex":325,"line":326,"speaker":"睚","text":"你煞费苦心，伙同那个疯疯癫癫的老东西一同诓我前来，就为了让我连通此处……和那枚丑陋的石头所在的空间？"},{"commandIndex":360,"line":361,"speaker":"睚","text":"报复。"}]}]}